# Public UI

## Route groups

| Group                    | Routes                                                                                                                    | Data                        |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |
| **Marketing** (PMA port) | `/`, `/for-hosts`, `/properties/*`, `/developments/*`, `/about`, `/contact`, `/support`, `/terms`, `/privacy`, `/cookies` | Phase 1: **mock data** only |
| **Operational**          | `/calendar`, `/form`, `/success`, `/sd-form`, `/bookings/:id/parking`                                                     | Live edge functions         |

No admin auth on these routes. Property scope via `?property=<slug>` or `?property_id=`.

## Marketing layout

- **`MarketingLayoutShell`** — nav, footer, `<Outlet />`, theme toggle
- **`MarketingImage`** — Vite substitute for Next.js `Image` (`fill`, `priority`, sizes)
- **`MarketingThemeToggle`** — light/dark (CSS variables)
- **React Router:** `Link to=` (not `href=`); `useSearchParams()` → `const [searchParams] = useSearchParams()`
- Guides: `docs/guides/routes/index-landing.md`, `properties.md`, `developments.md`

**Legacy:** `/?property=` redirects to `/calendar?property=` on the landing page.

## Calendar → form (operational)

`CalendarPage` at **`/calendar`** only. Preserves query params when navigating to `/form`.

Share links: `guestPublicPaths.guestCalendarPath(slug)` → `/calendar?property=`.

## Guest form

| Concern      | Location                                              |
| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| Main UI      | `ui/src/features/guest/form/components/GuestForm.tsx` |
| Schema       | `guestFormSchema.ts`                                  |
| Submit       | `submit-form` edge function (FormData)                |
| Booked dates | `get-booked-dates`                                    |

Production: full save path. Non-prod: checkbox panel; flags via FormData (not URL).

## SD refund / pay parking

- `/sd-form?bookingId=` — `get-sd-form`, `submit-sd-form`, `claim-sd-voucher`
- `/bookings/:bookingId/parking` — owner broadcast flow

## API calls

Use `VITE_SUPABASE_URL` + anon key. Pass `?property=` or `?property_id=` when scoped.

## UX

- Mobile-first (375px) — see `mobile-responsive.mdc`
- Minimal copy (`ui-minimal-copy.mdc`)
- Framer Motion animations preserved from PMA port

## Don'ts

- Require Google sign-in on public routes
- Expose admin URLs or service role in guest bundle
- Use Next.js `Image`, `styled-jsx`, or `href` on React Router `Link` in marketing code
- Assume marketing **Reserve** submits bookings — wire to `/form` in Phase 2

